# Branch roles for this repo

Full details: `BRANCHES.md` at the repo root. Summary:

- **`production`** — the live Sifty. Vercel deploys from it. All product work
  goes here via PRs into `production`.
- **`master`** — fresh pre-demo baseline (default branch). Only
  demo-baseline changes land here via PRs into `master`.
- **`demo-done`**, **`dragging-bug`** — demo branches reset by the demo
  setup script. Never open PRs against them.

Never merge `production` into `master`. Never land production-only features
on `master`. Never run demo reset scripts against `production`. Fixes flow
`master` → `production` only.

Merging: squash-merge your own PR into `production` only when CI is green,
Bugbot has no blocking comments, and the "Sifty Merge Gate" review says
ship. Never merge PRs into `master` or touch `demo-done` / `dragging-bug` —
only Santi does that.

Before creating a branch or PR, decide which base it belongs on. If the
task does not say and it is not obvious, ask rather than defaulting to
`master`.
